gPart="Verse"><p begin="9.128" end="17.155" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.128" end="10.448">That</span> <span begin="10.516" end="11.771">view</span> <span begin="12.029" end="12.199">of</span> <span begin="12.199" end="12.410">Por</span><span begin="12.410" end="12.522">to</span><span begin="12.522" end="12.852">fi</span><span begin="12.852" end="13.046">no</span> <span begin="13.046" end="13.381">was</span> <span begin="13.433" end="13.857">on</span> <span begin="13.857" end="14.096">my</span> <span begin="14.096" end="14.451">mind</span> <span begin="14.697" end="14.810">when</span> <span begin="14.810" end="14.945">you</span> <span begin="14.945" end="15.411">called</span> <span begin="15.411" end="15.539">me</span> <span begin="15.539" end="15.762">at</span> <span begin="15.762" end="15.920">the</span> <span begin="15.920" end="16.182">Pla</span><span begin="16.182" end="16.379">za</span> <span begin="16.379" end="16.568">A</span><span begin="16.568" end="16.802">thé</span><span begin="16.802" end="17.155">née</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你在雅典娜广场酒店给我打电话时 我脑海里浮现出菲诺港的景色</span></p><p begin="17.572" end="22.909" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.571" end="18.890">Ooh,</span> <span begin="18.890" end="19.081">of</span><span begin="19.081" end="19.299">ten</span><span begin="19.299" end="19.505">times</span> <span begin="19.505" end="19.718">it</span> <span begin="19.718" end="19.937">does</span><span begin="19.937" end="20.091">n&apos;t</span> <span begin="20.091" end="20.498">feel</span> <span begin="20.498" end="20.827">so</span> <span begin="20.885" end="21.367">glam</span><span begin="21.367" end="22.053">orous</span> <span begin="22.053" end="22.222">to</span> <span begin="22.222" end="22.489">be</span> <span begin="22.489" end="22.909">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢 很多时候做自己并没有那么光鲜亮丽</span></p><p begin="23.481" end="24.814" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.481" end="23.686">All</span> <span begin="23.686" end="23.892">the</span> <span begin="23.892" end="24.189">right</span> <span begin="24.271" end="24.765">guy</span><span begin="24.765" end="24.814">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有那些对的人</span></p><p begin="25.096" end="26.360" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.096" end="25.478">Promised</span> <span begin="25.478" end="25.779">they&apos;d</span> <span begin="25.779" end="25.931">s</span><span begin="25.931" end="26.360">tay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都曾承诺会留下来</span></p><p begin="26.781" end="28.052" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.781" end="26.988">Un</span><span begin="26.988" end="27.211">der</span> <span begin="27.211" end="27.686">bright</span> <span begin="27.686" end="27.999">light</span><span begin="27.999" end="28.052">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在聚光灯下</span></p><p begin="28.304" end="29.677" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.304" end="28.497">They</span> <span begin="28.497" end="28.709">with</span><span begin="28.709" end="28.921">ered</span> <span begin="28.921" end="29.280">a</span><span begin="29.280" end="29.677">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们都凋零枯萎了</span></p><p begin="29.751" end="32.131" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.751" end="29.858">But</span> <span begin="29.858" end="30.140">you</span> <span begin="30.503" end="32.131">bloom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你却绚烂绽放</span></p><p begin="32.185" end="36.499" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.185" end="32.438">Por</span><span begin="32.438" end="32.571">to</span><span begin="32.571" end="32.836">fi</span><span begin="32.836" end="33.070">no</span> <span begin="33.070" end="33.403">was</span> <span begin="33.403" end="33.848">on</span> <span begin="33.848" end="34.089">my</span> <span begin="34.089" end="34.570">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我脑海里浮现出菲诺港</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="34.710" end="36.499"><span begin="34.710" end="34.915">(And</span> <span begin="34.915" end="35.064">I</span> <span begin="35.064" end="35.275">think</span> <span begin="35.275" end="35.525">you</span> <span begin="35.525" end="35.885">know</span> <span begin="35.885" end="36.499">why)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想你知道为什么</span></span></p></div><div begin="36.537" end="43.140" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="36.537" end="43.140" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.537" end="36.700">And</span> <span begin="36.775" end="37.338">i</span><span begin="37.338" end="37.430">f</span> <span begin="37.430" end="38.071">your</span> <span begin="38.071" end="38.701">let</span><span begin="38.701" end="38.957">ters</span> <span begin="39.248" end="39.427">e</span><span begin="39.427" end="39.994">ver</span> <span begin="39.994" end="40.646">said,</span> <span begin="40.646" end="41.304">&quot;Good</span><span begin="41.304" end="43.140">bye&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你的信里曾写下“再见”</span></p></div><div begin="44.723" end="1:22.793" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="44.723" end="47.405" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.723" end="45.367">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="45.445" end="45.942">cry</span> <span begin="45.942" end="46.371">my</span> <span begin="46.371" end="46.750">eyes</span> <span begin="46.750" end="47.066">vi</span><span begin="47.066" end="47.221">o</span><span begin="47.221" end="47.405">let</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会哭到双眼发紫</span></p><p begin="47.433" end="49.234" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.433" end="47.618">E</span><span begin="47.618" end="47.956">liza</span><span begin="48.023" end="48.331">beth</span> <span begin="48.382" end="48.873">Tay</span><span begin="48.873" end="49.234">lor</span></p><p begin="49.298" end="50.230" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.298" end="49.490">Tell</span> <span begin="49.490" end="49.648">me</span> <span begin="49.648" end="49.948">for</span> <span begin="49.948" end="50.230">real</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请如实告诉我</span></p><p begin="50.573" end="52.112" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.573" end="50.718">Do</span> <span begin="50.718" end="50.891">you</span> <span begin="50.891" end="51.148">think</span> <span begin="51.148" end="51.339">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="51.339" end="51.560">for</span><span begin="51.560" end="51.794">e</span><span begin="51.794" end="52.074">ver</span><span begin="52.074" end="52.112">?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你觉得这是永恒吗</span></p><p begin="52.426" end="55.494" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.426" end="52.664">Been</span> <span begin="52.664" end="53.040">num</span><span begin="53.040" end="53.431">ber</span> <span begin="53.431" end="53.842">one,</span> <span begin="53.842" end="54.091">but</span> <span begin="54.091" end="54.289">I</span> <span begin="54.289" end="54.515">nev</span><span begin="54.515" end="54.671">er</span> <span begin="54.671" end="55.022">had</span> <span begin="55.091" end="55.494">two</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾是第一 但从未有过第二人陪伴</span></p><p begin="55.533" end="58.706" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.533" end="55.781">And</span> <span begin="55.781" end="55.907">I</span> <span begin="55.953" end="56.379">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="56.379" end="56.720">have</span> <span begin="56.720" end="57.213">fun</span> <span begin="57.213" end="57.312">i</span><span begin="57.312" end="57.411">f</span> <span begin="57.411" end="57.571">I</span> <span begin="57.616" end="58.051">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="58.051" end="58.512">have</span> <span begin="58.512" end="58.706">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果不能拥有你 我就无法快乐</span></p><p begin="58.936" end="1:02.7