an><span begin="3:26.192" end="3:26.345">ly</span><span begin="3:26.345" end="3:26.750">wood</span> <span begin="3:26.750" end="3:27.080">hate</span><span begin="3:27.080" end="3:27.163">s</span> <span begin="3:27.163" end="3:27.419">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 当好莱坞厌弃我时 请成为我的纽约</span></p><p begin="3:27.436" end="3:30.697" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:27.436" end="3:27.572">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="3:27.572" end="3:28.083">only</span> <span begin="3:28.083" end="3:28.217">as</span> <span begin="3:28.217" end="3:28.619">hot</span> <span begin="3:28.860" end="3:29.064">as</span> <span begin="3:29.064" end="3:29.274">your</span> <span begin="3:29.274" end="3:29.641">last</span> <span begin="3:29.641" end="3:30.008">hit,</span> <span begin="3:30.048" end="3:30.527">ba</span><span begin="3:30.527" end="3:30.697">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的热度只取决于你上一首热单 宝贝</span></p><p begin="3:31.016" end="3:33.792" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:31.016" end="3:31.199">Been</span> <span begin="3:31.199" end="3:31.403">num</span><span begin="3:31.403" end="3:31.748">ber</span> <span begin="3:31.748" end="3:32.087">one,</span> <span begin="3:32.352" end="3:32.455">but</span> <span begin="3:32.455" end="3:32.597">I</span> <span begin="3:32.597" end="3:32.789">ne</span><span begin="3:32.789" end="3:32.970">ver</span> <span begin="3:32.970" end="3:33.451">had</span> <span begin="3:33.451" end="3:33.792">two</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾是第一 但从未有过第二人陪伴</span></p><p begin="3:33.862" end="3:42.357" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.862" end="3:34.116">And</span> <span begin="3:34.116" end="3:34.221">I</span> <span begin="3:34.265" end="3:34.701">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:34.701" end="3:35.007">have</span> <span begin="3:35.083" end="3:35.579">fun</span> <span begin="3:35.579" end="3:35.728">i</span><span begin="3:35.728" end="3:35.813">f</span> <span begin="3:35.813" end="3:35.917">I</span> <span begin="3:35.962" end="3:36.344">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:36.389" end="3:37.445">ha</span><span begin="3:37.445" end="3:37.661">ve</span> <span begin="3:37.661" end="3:42.357">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果不能拥有你 我就无法快乐</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:39.025" end="3:41.004"><span begin="3:39.025" end="3:39.190">(E</span><span begin="3:39.190" end="3:39.600">liza</span><span begin="3:39.600" end="3:39.932">beth</span> <span begin="3:39.989" end="3:40.462">Tay</span><span begin="3:40.462" end="3:41.004">lor)</span></span></p><p begin="3:43.017" end="3:47.853" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:43.017" end="3:45.408">Oh,</span> <span begin="3:45.683" end="3:45.878">E</span><span begin="3:45.878" end="3:46.375">liza</span><span begin="3:46.375" end="3:46.747">beth</span> <span begin="3:46.747" end="3:47.229">Tay</span><span begin="3:47.229" end="3:47.853">lor</span></p></div><div begin="3:50.770" end="4:02.200" itunes:songPart="Outro"><p begin="3:50.770" end="3:53.818" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:50.770" end="3:51.011">Been</span> <span begin="3:51.011" end="3:51.355">num</span><span begin="3:51.355" end="3:51.742">ber</span> <span begin="3:51.742" end="3:52.060">one,</span> <span begin="3:52.207" end="3:52.421">but</span> <span begin="3:52.421" end="3:52.563">I</span> <span begin="3:52.647" end="3:52.818">ne</span><span begin="3:52.818" end="3:53.015">ver</span> <span begin="3:53.015" end="3:53.450">had</span> <span begin="3:53.450" end="3:53.818">two</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾是第一 但从未有过第二人陪伴</span></p><p begin="3:54.109" end="4:02.200" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:54.109" end="3:54.198">And</span> <span begin="3:54.198" end="3:54.314">I</span> <span begin="3:54.348" end="3:54.712">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:54.712" end="3:55.034">have</span> <span begin="3:55.034" end="3:55.573">fun</s